      "title_zh": "日本书店",
      "title_en": "The Japanese bookshop",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["星期天", "，", "我", "去", "了", "一", "个", "日本", "书店", "。", "那里", "有", "很", "多", "电影", "里", "的", "东西", "。"],
        ["我", "在", "那里", "看", "了", "半天", "，", "一", "点", "也", "不", "想", "走", "。"],
        ["晚上", "七", "点", "，", "书店", "要", "关", "门", "了", "。", "我", "还", "想", "看", "！"],
        ["我", "买", "了", "两", "本", "书", "，", "就", "回家", "了", "。", "晚上", "，", "我", "在", "床", "上", "读", "了", "两", "个", "小时", "。", "这些", "书", "都", "很", "好看", "！"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "On Sunday I went to a Japanese bookshop. There were lots of things from films there.",
        "I spent ages looking around and didn't want to leave at all.",
        "At seven in the evening the bookshop was about to close. I still wanted to keep looking!",
        "I bought two books and went home. In the evening I read in bed for two hours. Both books are great!"
      ],
      "names": ["日本"],
      "new_words": ["星期天", "书店", "半天"],
